{
  "name": "session-two-writers-server-cli",
  "about": "同一个会话有两个写者：server 已经载入某会话（跑过一轮，会话留在它的内存里）时，不带子命令的默认对话连不上 server（它只探 18789，bbx 保证那里没人监听），在进程内起 gateway 对同一会话（cli:project=<cwd>:default，项目已登记）续一轮；server 再续一轮。之后另起一个默认对话进程、再重启 server，各续一轮。基线的会话写入是 appendFile 追加（session/persistence/JsonlSessionPersistence.ts:20-37），序号取自进程内存（session/events/SessionRuntime.ts:64），所以 server 的第二轮与 CLI 那一轮用了同一段 sequence；之后任何新进程载入这个会话都在 validateSessionEventLog（session/events/SessionEventLogValidation.ts:35-39）报 Session event sequence must increase strictly，会话再也续不上。默认对话在基线上输出完不退出，cli 步骤都声明 expectTimeout，比较被杀之前的输出。",
  "server": false,
  "env": {
    "DOCKER_CONTAINER": "1",
    "COMMIT_HASH": "bbx"
  },
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/projects/private-tmp-pdrs-bbx-root-proj/.cwd": "{PROJECT}\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Two writers\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "reply": {
        "text": "ok."
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "cli:project={PROJECT}:default",
            "channelKey": "cli",
            "projectKey": "{PROJECT}",
            "message": "server-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "cli": [
            "cli-1"
          ],
          "timeout": 10000,
          "expectTimeout": true
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "cli:project={PROJECT}:default",
            "channelKey": "cli",
            "projectKey": "{PROJECT}",
            "message": "server-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "disconnect": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cli": [
        "cli-2"
      ],
      "timeout": 10000,
      "expectTimeout": true
    },
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "connect": true
        },
        {
          "ws": "read_session_messages",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "cli:project={PROJECT}:default",
            "projectKey": "{PROJECT}"
          }
        },
        {
          "ws": "submit_turn",
          "params": {
            "sessionKey": "cli:project={PROJECT}:default",
            "channelKey": "cli",
            "projectKey": "{PROJECT}",
            "message": "server-3"
          }
        },
        {
          "disconnect": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "accepted": [
    {
      "id": "second-writer-rejected-not-corrupting",
      "why": "基线 bug（会话损坏）：同一会话先后有两个进程写入时，基线每个进程用内存里的序号追加、不重读文件（JsonlSessionPersistence.ts:20-37、SessionRuntime.ts:64），序号重复，之后任何进程续这个会话都报「Session event sequence must increase strictly」，重启也恢复不了。Rust 用跨进程单写者栅栏拒绝第二个写者（对外是 gateway_submit_failed「Session writer is still draining; retry session recreation.」），会话文件完好、之后续写正常。从被拒那一步起两侧走向不同，所以放过的范围宽：被拒的那一步与其后步骤的输出、这个会话的文件与投影、运行记录、发给 provider 的请求。拿掉栅栏后这些路径大多不再有差异，比较器会把没命中的登记报为过期，场景照样判不一致；Rust 拒绝时的输出形状由单元测试守住，对拍看不出它被改坏",
      "paths": [
        "^\\$\\.steps\\[0\\]\\.then\\[1\\]\\.cli\\.",
        "^\\$\\.steps\\[1\\]\\.cli\\.",
        "^\\$\\.steps\\[2\\]\\.serve\\.",
        "^\\$\\.steps\\[2\\]\\.then\\[[12]\\]\\.frames",
        "^\\$\\.tree\\..*/chats/cli:project=[^/]*:default\\.jsonl\\.",
        "^\\$\\.tree\\./home/\\.pilotdeck/runs/registry\\.json\\.",
        "^\\$\\.provider\\.main"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
